{"seq":2,"slug":"package-manager-workspaces","title":"包管理器 Workspaces：pnpm/npm/yarn 对比与实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/foundations/package-manager-workspaces","wordCount":1451,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"包管理器-workspaces-pnpm-npm-yarn-对比与实践\">包管理器 Workspaces：pnpm/npm/yarn 对比与实践</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Workspaces</td>\n<td>包管理器将多个本地包互相链接的机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hoisting（提升）</td>\n<td>将子包依赖提升到根 node_modules 以减少重复安装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幽灵依赖</td>\n<td>包未声明但通过 hoisting 可访问的依赖，是 npm/yarn v1 的隐患</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚拟存储</td>\n<td>pnpm 使用全局 store + 符号链接实现严格依赖隔离的机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PnP（Plug&#39;n&#39;Play）</td>\n<td>yarn v2+ 放弃 node_modules，用运行时映射解析模块路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>workspace 协议</td>\n<td>pnpm/yarn 支持的 <code>workspace:*</code> 语法，引用本地包并在发布时替换为实际版本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"workspaces-机制的本质\">Workspaces 机制的本质</h2><p>包管理器 Workspaces 是 Monorepo 的基础设施层。其核心作用是<strong>在本地开发时将 workspace 内各包互相链接</strong>，使得包 A 依赖包 B 时，实际解析到本地源码而非 registry 上的已发布版本。</p>\n<p>三大包管理器（pnpm、npm、yarn）均支持 workspaces，但在实现机制、磁盘占用和安全边界上存在显著差异。</p>\n<h3 id=\"node_modules-结构的根本差异\">node_modules 结构的根本差异</h3><p>这是三个工具最核心的差异所在：</p>\n<p><strong>npm/yarn（v1）的平铺（hoisting）策略</strong>：将所有依赖尽量提升到根 <code>node_modules</code>，子包直接共享。这种策略会产生&quot;幽灵依赖&quot;问题——包 A 未在 <code>package.json</code> 中声明某个依赖，却能通过 <code>require()</code> 访问到（因为被提升到根目录）。</p>\n<p><strong>yarn v2+（Berry）的 PnP 策略</strong>：完全放弃 <code>node_modules</code>，改用 <code>.yarn/cache</code> + <code>.pnp.cjs</code> 映射文件。所有模块路径通过 PnP 运行时解析，从根本上消除幽灵依赖，但与部分旧工具的兼容性是挑战。</p>\n<p><strong>pnpm 的虚拟存储（virtual store）策略</strong>：全局内容可寻址存储（<code>~/.pnpm-store</code>）+ 项目内 <code>node_modules/.pnpm/</code> 虚拟存储层。每个包只能访问其 <code>package.json</code> 中显式声明的依赖，严格隔离，同时通过硬链接节省磁盘空间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph hoisting[&quot;npm/yarn v1 hoisting&quot;]&#10;        A1[root/node_modules/react]&#10;        A2[root/node_modules/lodash]&#10;        A3[packages/app/node_modules/]&#10;        A4[empty - hoisted to root]&#10;        A3 --&gt; A4&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph virtual[&quot;pnpm virtual store&quot;]&#10;        B1[pnpm-store/react-18]&#10;        B2[node_modules/.pnpm/react-18]&#10;        B3[packages/app/node_modules/react]&#10;        B1 -- hardlink --&gt; B2&#10;        B2 -- symlink --&gt; B3&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph hoisting[\"npm/yarn v1 hoisting\"]\n        A1[root/node_modules/react]\n        A2[root/node_modules/lodash]\n        A3[packages/app/node_modules/]\n        A4[empty - hoisted to root]\n        A3 --&gt; A4\n    end\n\n    subgraph virtual[\"pnpm virtual store\"]\n        B1[pnpm-store/react-18]\n        B2[node_modules/.pnpm/react-18]\n        B3[packages/app/node_modules/react]\n        B1 -- hardlink --&gt; B2\n        B2 -- symlink --&gt; B3\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"pnpm-workspaces-深度解析\">pnpm Workspaces 深度解析</h2><p>pnpm 是目前前端 Monorepo 场景下最推荐的包管理器，其在严格性、磁盘效率和性能上有综合优势。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基础配置\">基础配置</h3><p>在项目根目录创建 <code>pnpm-workspace.yaml</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"packages:&#10;  - &#39;apps/*&#39;&#10;  - &#39;packages/*&#39;&#10;  - &#39;tooling/*&#39;&#10;  # 排除特定目录&#10;  - &#39;!**/test/**&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apps/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'packages/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tooling/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 排除特定目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'!**/test/**'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>根 <code>package.json</code> 的关键配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;my-monorepo&quot;,&#10;  &quot;private&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;engines&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;node&quot;: &quot;&gt;=18&quot;,&#10;    &quot;pnpm&quot;: &quot;&gt;=8&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;packageManager&quot;: &quot;pnpm@8.15.0&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my-monorepo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"private\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"engines\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"node\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\">=18\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"pnpm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\">=8\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"packageManager\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm@8.15.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>packageManager</code> 字段配合 <code>corepack</code> 可以锁定包管理器版本，防止团队成员使用不同版本导致 lockfile 不一致。</p>\n<h3 id=\"workspace-协议与版本范围\">workspace 协议与版本范围</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;dependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;@myorg/utils&quot;: &quot;workspace:*&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@myorg/ui&quot;: &quot;workspace:^&quot;,&#10;    &quot;@myorg/config&quot;: &quot;workspace:~1.0.0&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:^\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/config\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"workspace:~1.0.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>workspace:*</code></td>\n<td>总是链接到本地版本，发布时替换为当前实际版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workspace:^</code></td>\n<td>发布时替换为 <code>^x.y.z</code> 兼容范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workspace:~</code></td>\n<td>发布时替换为 <code>~x.y.z</code> 补丁范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workspace:1.0.0</code></td>\n<td>发布时替换为精确版本 <code>1.0.0</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>pnpm publish</code> 和 Changesets 都能正确处理 workspace 协议，在发布时将其替换为真实版本号。</p>\n<h3 id=\"常用命令模式\">常用命令模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 为所有 workspace 安装依赖&#10;pnpm install&#10;&#10;# 仅为特定包安装依赖&#10;pnpm --filter @myorg/web add react&#10;&#10;# 为所有包运行脚本&#10;pnpm -r run build&#10;&#10;# 在所有包中并行运行脚本&#10;pnpm -r --parallel run lint&#10;&#10;# 仅在有该脚本的包中运行（--if-present 防止报错）&#10;pnpm -r --if-present run test&#10;&#10;# 从根目录运行单个包的脚本&#10;pnpm --filter @myorg/web dev\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 为所有 workspace 安装依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 仅为特定包安装依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @myorg/web</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> react</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 为所有包运行脚本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在所有包中并行运行脚本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --parallel</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 仅在有该脚本的包中运行（--if-present 防止报错）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --if-present</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从根目录运行单个包的脚本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @myorg/web</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>--filter</code> 支持丰富的过滤语法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 过滤单个包&#10;pnpm --filter @myorg/web build&#10;&#10;# 过滤包及其所有依赖（含传递依赖）&#10;pnpm --filter @myorg/web... build&#10;&#10;# 过滤包及所有依赖此包的包&#10;pnpm --filter ...@myorg/utils build&#10;&#10;# 过滤 glob 匹配的包&#10;pnpm --filter &#39;./packages/**&#39; build&#10;&#10;# 过滤自上次 git 提交以来有变更的包&#10;pnpm --filter &#39;[HEAD~1]&#39; build\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 过滤单个包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @myorg/web</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 过滤包及其所有依赖（含传递依赖）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @myorg/web...</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 过滤包及所有依赖此包的包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ...@myorg/utils</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 过滤 glob 匹配的包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './packages/**'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 过滤自上次 git 提交以来有变更的包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '[HEAD~1]'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"npm-workspaces\">npm Workspaces</h2><p>npm v7+ 内置 workspaces 支持，配置更简单但能力较弱。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基础配置\">基础配置</h3><p>在根 <code>package.json</code> 中声明：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;my-monorepo&quot;,&#10;  &quot;private&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;workspaces&quot;: [&quot;apps/*&quot;, &quot;packages/*&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my-monorepo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"private\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"workspaces\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"apps/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"packages/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>npm workspaces 采用平铺的 hoisting 策略，不支持 <code>workspace:</code> 协议（使用 <code>*</code> 范围代替）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;dependencies&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;@myorg/utils&quot;: &quot;*&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"@myorg/utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"*\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"npm-workspaces-的局限性\">npm workspaces 的局限性</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>幽灵依赖问题</strong>：hoisting 策略使得包可以访问未声明的依赖</li>\n<li><strong>无严格隔离</strong>：无法像 pnpm 那样限制包只访问声明的依赖</li>\n<li><strong>workspace 协议缺失</strong>：内部包引用语义不如 pnpm 清晰</li>\n<li><strong>性能</strong>：多次重复安装相同依赖，磁盘占用远高于 pnpm</li>\n</ul>\n<p>npm workspaces 适合<strong>不想引入额外工具链的小型项目</strong>，或已深度依赖 npm 生态的团队。</p>\n<h2 id=\"yarn-workspaces-v1-vs-v2\">yarn Workspaces（v1 vs v2+）</h2><p>yarn 存在两个差异显著的主要版本，使用前需确认版本。</p>\n<h3 id=\"yarn-v1-classic\">yarn v1（Classic）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;private&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;workspaces&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;packages&quot;: [&quot;packages/*&quot;, &quot;apps/*&quot;],&#10;    &quot;nohoist&quot;: [&quot;**/react-native&quot;, &quot;**/react-native/**&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"private\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"workspaces\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"packages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"packages/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"apps/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"nohoist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"**/react-native\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"**/react-native/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>nohoist</code> 配置允许指定某些包不被提升，用于解决特定工具（如 React Native）对 node_modules 路径有特殊要求的问题。</p>\n<p>yarn v1 目前处于维护模式，不建议新项目使用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"yarn-v2-berry-与-pnp\">yarn v2+（Berry）与 PnP</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .yarnrc.yml&#10;nodeLinker: pnp\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .yarnrc.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">nodeLinker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnp</span></span></code></pre></div><p>切换到 PnP 模式后，依赖不再写入 <code>node_modules</code>，而是通过 <code>.pnp.cjs</code> 运行时解析。这带来：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>零安装</strong>：将 <code>.yarn/cache</code> 提交到 git，无需 <code>yarn install</code></li>\n<li><strong>严格模式</strong>：幽灵依赖在运行时报错而非静默访问</li>\n<li><strong>IDE 支持</strong>：需要安装 <code>@yarnpkg/sdks</code> 配置 TypeScript/ESLint 的路径解析</li>\n</ul>\n<p>PnP 的主要挑战是<strong>工具兼容性</strong>：部分工具（如某些 webpack 插件、Jest 配置）需要额外适配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种工具选型对比\">三种工具选型对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>pnpm</th>\n<th>npm</th>\n<th>yarn v1</th>\n<th>yarn v2+</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>node_modules 策略</td>\n<td>虚拟存储+符号链接</td>\n<td>平铺 hoisting</td>\n<td>平铺 hoisting</td>\n<td>PnP（无 node_modules）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幽灵依赖防护</td>\n<td>强（严格隔离）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>强（PnP 模式）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁盘效率</td>\n<td>极高（全局 store+硬链接）</td>\n<td>低（重复安装）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（zip 缓存）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>workspace 协议</td>\n<td>支持（<code>workspace:*</code>）</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安装速度</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>快（有缓存时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具兼容性</td>\n<td>极好</td>\n<td>极好</td>\n<td>极好</td>\n<td>需额外配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社区生态</td>\n<td>快速增长</td>\n<td>成熟</td>\n<td>衰退中</td>\n<td>较小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐场景</td>\n<td>新 Monorepo 首选</td>\n<td>无额外要求的小项目</td>\n<td>历史遗留项目</td>\n<td>追求零安装的团队</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"锁文件管理最佳实践\">锁文件管理最佳实践</h2><p>无论使用哪种包管理器，锁文件（<code>package-lock.json</code>、<code>pnpm-lock.yaml</code>、<code>yarn.lock</code>）都必须提交到 git。</p>\n<p><strong>禁止在 Monorepo 中混用包管理器</strong>：不同包管理器生成的锁文件相互冲突。在根目录的 <code>package.json</code> 中添加 <code>preinstall</code> 脚本来强制执行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;preinstall&quot;: &quot;npx only-allow pnpm&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"preinstall\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"npx only-allow pnpm\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这会在非 pnpm 用户运行 <code>npm install</code> 或 <code>yarn</code> 时报错，防止意外产生错误的锁文件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>包管理器的选择对 Monorepo 工程质量有深远影响：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>新项目首选 pnpm</strong>：严格依赖隔离 + 高磁盘效率 + workspace 协议是综合最优的组合</li>\n<li><strong>已有 npm 项目</strong>：可继续使用 npm workspaces，但需接受幽灵依赖风险；大规模时建议迁移 pnpm</li>\n<li><strong>yarn v1 项目</strong>：应计划向 pnpm 或 yarn v2+ 迁移，v1 已停止新功能开发</li>\n<li><strong>workspace 协议</strong>（<code>workspace:*</code>）是引用内部包的最佳方式，语义清晰且支持发布时版本替换</li>\n<li><strong>锁文件必须提交</strong>，且通过 <code>preinstall</code> 脚本强制统一包管理器版本</li>\n<li><strong>不在根目录安装业务依赖</strong>：根 <code>package.json</code> 只放工具链依赖</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>本章节相关文档：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"monorepo-architecture-patterns\">Monorepo 架构模式</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"dependency-graph-management\">依赖图管理</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"包管理器 Workspaces：pnpm/npm/yarn 对比与实践","id":"包管理器-workspaces-pnpm-npm-yarn-对比与实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Workspaces 机制的本质","id":"workspaces-机制的本质"},{"level":3,"text":"node_modules 结构的根本差异","id":"node_modules-结构的根本差异"},{"level":2,"text":"pnpm Workspaces 深度解析","id":"pnpm-workspaces-深度解析"},{"level":3,"text":"基础配置","id":"基础配置"},{"level":3,"text":"workspace 协议与版本范围","id":"workspace-协议与版本范围"},{"level":3,"text":"常用命令模式","id":"常用命令模式"},{"level":2,"text":"npm Workspaces","id":"npm-workspaces"},{"level":3,"text":"基础配置","id":"基础配置"},{"level":3,"text":"npm workspaces 的局限性","id":"npm-workspaces-的局限性"},{"level":2,"text":"yarn Workspaces（v1 vs v2+）","id":"yarn-workspaces-v1-vs-v2"},{"level":3,"text":"yarn v1（Classic）","id":"yarn-v1-classic"},{"level":3,"text":"yarn v2+（Berry）与 PnP","id":"yarn-v2-berry-与-pnp"},{"level":2,"text":"三种工具选型对比","id":"三种工具选型对比"},{"level":2,"text":"锁文件管理最佳实践","id":"锁文件管理最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Monorepo 架构模式：决策框架与设计原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/foundations/monorepo-architecture-patterns"},"next":{"title":"依赖图管理：内部包依赖解析与治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-monorepo-tooling/foundations/dependency-graph-management"}}